!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
Aries: Gift received represents love - beautiful, rare vase could be it. 
Attention centers around home, beauty, music, love letters. Financial
surprise due.  

Taurus: Agreement signed, sealed, delivered.  Request granted, clause
revised.  Focus on long-term relationship.  Pisces involved.

Gemini: What was a lost opportunity boomerangs in your favor.  Long-range
prospects bright, journey overseas part of exciting cycle.  Passionate
relationship lends spice.

Cancer: Added re1cognition featured, views vindicated. Aries 1person who was
skeptical confides, "From now on regard me as your ally."

Leo: A fresh start leads to promotion, public relations, discovery of soul
mate.  Another Leo suggests creative enterprise.

Virgo: What apparently slipped through your fingers was part of half-baked
scheme.  You'll recover loss, gain recover morally, financially -- love will
not be a stranger.

Libra: Study details, locate missing link, ingredient.  Pay heed to
investment counsel.  Opposite sex confides, "You exude powerful
vibrations."  Taurus involved.

Scorpio: Another Scorpio suggests, "Let's make a film, let the world know of
our product, talent."  This is not the time. what begins as idea becomes the
real thing.

Sagittarius: Fight for privacy.  If you tell all, you lose respect of those
around you.  Discretion necessary for success, love.

Capricorn: Utilize hidden talent in connection with design, floral
arrangement.  Attention revolves around home, music.  Wish is fulfilled.

Aquarius: Promotion long delayed comes. Emphasis on power play,
responsibility, time limitation, give of valuable gem.

Pisces: Invitation to travel relates to romance, inspiration, chance to
discover soul mate.  Scorpio moon emphasizes creativity, controversy,
sensuality.  Cancer native plays role.
